OL,3,GNEWSAFamily left with nothing as
OL,4,Abonfire spreads to home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family have been left with nothing
OL,7,Fafter a bonfire's flames spread to
OL,8,Ftheir home and destroyed all of their
OL,9,Fbelongings, a fire service has said.
OL,11,FMum-of-two Milly Reilly managed to
OL,12,Fescape the blaze in Tredworth,
OL,13,FGloucester, with daughter Darcie, 6,
OL,14,Fson Ellis, 2, and their dog Fred at
OL,15,Fabout 11:30 BST on 12 August.
OL,17,FNo-one was injured in the incident and
OL,18,Fthe family are now staying with friends
OL,19,Fand family. They have no timeline for
OL,20,Fhow long repair work might take before
OL,21,Fthey can move back into their privately
OL,22,Frented home.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
