OL,3,GNEWSAFamily left with nothing as
OL,4,Abonfire spreads to home
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid it is believed a bonfire caught
OL,8,Fthe rear of the two-storey property and
OL,9,Fspread to inside the home.
